      "value": "@{5aff9c434883ee6a2a855689|full_name}: play space mover doesn't affect fov it just moves your head position by holding the menu button and dragging your self around. If there is something on the ground that I normally can't pick up I just hold much menu button and lower myself further so I can. You by now have seen people with full body tracking move up and down in mid air. Same thing except without full body you won't leave the ground.",
