      "value": "@{5aff9c434883ee6a2a855689|full_name}: I'm aware of that,  but I do have to keep adjusting it, and sometimes that causes vrchat to suddenly have unexplained lag, a random chance of occuring, and gets stuck that way, till i restart. \n\nAs for what i refer to, its that the head doesn't always stay lined up with my own.  Sometimes when on my back the head would move in front of me,  where i see my neck.  Or on my stomach itd move up higher than where I'm supposed to be",
