      "value": "What they maybe could do (I think their limited by the assetbundle thing they use maybe more) is allow you to change proportions of avatars IN GAME\nBut for now if you've made an avatar just toss it in blender and use this real quick\nhttps://github.com/triazo/immersive_scaler/releases/",
