  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I use an MMD avatar, and when I try to sit or lay down, the legs are longer than mine. I get that this is an MMD avatar and most of them are unproportionate for the legs, but if you set your playspace in Advanced Settings to 0.40 and adjust your height, they'll be lined up. However, making your height really small, makes your hands really small also. If someone knows how to fix this, without editing bones in blender, (that doesn't work for me) please let me know, or VRChat, please fix this.",
